        <mxCell id="probe_pod_text" value="&lt;b&gt;3&#160;&#160;LB-selected probe candidate Pod P&lt;sub&gt;p&lt;/sub&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;returns PROBE_READY(P&lt;sub&gt;p&lt;/sub&gt;, X&lt;sub&gt;p&lt;/sub&gt;, B&lt;sub&gt;p&lt;/sub&gt;, H&lt;sub&gt;p&lt;/sub&gt;, token, TTL) on p&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#9A6700&quot;&gt;no SUBSCRIBE frames and no dequeue; only if a&lt;sup&gt;mig&lt;/sup&gt; is selected and remains admissible is this same socket promoted to c&lt;sub&gt;t&lt;/sub&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontColor=#344054;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
